        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kfxtrVIy4oVd-1fiEtGqCpi7_-8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24227-christmas-plum-pudding-VAT-step-04-38ce03349bab4515a984ad93fe0dfed8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24227/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stand puddings on a trivet in a large pot of boiling water that reaches halfway up the sides of the pudding basin.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ENpcaP5Fe0-rbIGBydx1Mc9YEzc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24227-christmas-plum-pudding-VAT-step-05-84305cda8029477eaf02f330ece9923d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24227/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Steam puddings over medium-low heat in boiling water 10 hours for large puddings, 5 hours for small puddings, topping up water regularly until puddings are quite firm and set.",
